WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
g8s submit — a task enters the queue

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.400
QUEUED · one attempt = one worktree = one receipt

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.600
a write receipt is minted — paths bound, 55 minutes to live

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.200
the worker edits three files in scope — then one outside it

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.400
E_DIFF_FIREWALL_OUT_OF_SCOPE — the gate refuses, the worktree is quarantined

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.600
a fresh receipt — the scope widened the right way

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.600
retry: layer_ownership PASS · coverage_ratchet PASS · sast_triad PASS

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.800
verify — 6/6 checks, evidence attached

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.400
commit — with its receipt in the trailer. lineage intact.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.000
g8s — gated. receipted. auditable. signed.
